WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.790
- So what memories of
Chadwick do you have?

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:02.820
Do you have any great ones?

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:06.141
- Let's say, what was
maybe about 15 years ago?

00:00:06.141 --> 00:00:09.051
I was given, thankful and grateful for a

00:00:09.051 --> 00:00:11.760
honorary PhD from Howard university.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.593
- [Kelly] Oh, wow.

00:00:12.593 --> 00:00:13.840
- [Taylor] Yeah. So I went there.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.217
- That's amazing.

00:00:15.217 --> 00:00:16.050
- Thanks.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.740
And he was my guide, he
was my student guide.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.077
- [Kelly] Wait, like before he was acting?

00:00:21.077 --> 00:00:22.800
- [Taylor] Before anything and everything.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.633
- [Kelly] Are you serious?

00:00:23.633 --> 00:00:26.040
- [Taylor] Yeah, he was an actor there.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.559
- What a full circle moment.

00:00:27.559 --> 00:00:28.392
- Mhmm.

00:00:28.392 --> 00:00:29.890
- Did he tell you that,
whenever y'all were?

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:32.650
- He told me that at the opening party,

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:33.820
at the premier party.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.831
I was like, ahhhh, you cold water.

00:00:36.831 --> 00:00:38.032
(laughter)

00:00:38.032 --> 00:00:39.817
I can't hold water. You know.

00:00:39.817 --> 00:00:42.380
- He didn't tell you the
whole time you were filming?

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.540
- And we sat next to
each other every morning

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:45.760
in the makeup chair.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.280
You know as we're getting
our lines, and our accents,

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.010
and our work together for the day.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:51.843
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:54.730
- He's just amazing. And
he reminded me of that.

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:57.171
- I would've had to have
been like, blah, we've met.

00:00:57.171 --> 00:00:58.240
- Yeah, me too. Me too.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.073
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:59.073 --> 00:01:01.380
That's so cool though, I love
those full circle moments.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:02.290
That's really, really cool.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:03.727
- Amazing, amazing man.

